    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "The OpenHands platform has been evaluated on 15 established benchmarks, covering software engineering, web browsing, and miscellaneous assistance tasks. The results show that OpenHands agents are competitive with other state-of-the-art agents, demonstrating their ability to perform a wide range of tasks. For example, the <strong>CodeActAgent</strong> achieved a competitive resolve rate of 26% on the SWE-Bench Lite benchmark, and successfully fixed 79.3% of bugs in the HumanEvalFix benchmark.",
